flowchart LR
  ClientREST[Client REST] --> Messaging[messaging-service]
  ClientWS[Client WebSocket] -->|/ws/realtime| Messaging
  Producers[Backend domain producers] --> ProducerOutbox[(Producer outbox_event)]
  ProducerOutbox --> Relay[ProducerOutboxRelay]
  Relay -->|authenticated event ingress| Inbox[(messaging_db inbox_event)]
  Inbox --> Handler[Inbox worker + event handlers]
  Handler --> Notification[(notification)]
  Notification --> Delivery[(messaging_db outbox_event)]
  Delivery --> Worker[Delivery worker]
  Worker --> ClientWS
  Messaging --> Projections[(access/block projections)]
  Messaging --> DB[(messaging_db)]
  Governance[Governance API fallback] -. fail-close block check .-> Messaging
